---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hot-Dip Galvanizing" description="In-house hot-dip galvanizing per ISO 1461 / ASTM A123 for maximum corrosion protection.">
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <p class="text-brand-500 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Capabilities</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Hot-Dip Galvanizing</h1>
    <p class="text-steel-500 text-lg mb-12 max-w-3xl">Corrosion protection is critical for tower longevity — especially in tropical and coastal environments.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Specifications</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-steel-600">
          <li><strong>Standards:</strong> ISO 1461 / ASTM A123</li>
          <li><strong>Zinc bath:</strong> [X.X] × [X.X] × [X.X] m</li>
          <li><strong>Zinc purity:</strong> ≥ 98.5%</li>
          <li><strong>Coating:</strong> 86–200 μm</li>
          <li><strong>Daily capacity:</strong> [XX] MT</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Process</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-steel-600 list-decimal list-inside">
          <li>Degreasing</li>
          <li>Pickling</li>
          <li>Rinsing</li>
          <li>Flux application</li>
          <li>Drying</li>
          <li>Zinc immersion (450°C)</li>
          <li>Cooling & inspection</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-brand-50 border border-brand-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Why In-House Galvanizing Matters</h2>
      <p class="text-steel-600">With our own line, we control zinc temperature, immersion time, and inspection — resulting in consistent quality and faster lead times.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
